## 3. Implementing the Delegate
 
Create a `@Service` that implements the delegate interface and override only the methods you need:
 
```java
@Service
public class UsersService implements UsersApiDelegate {
 
    @Override
    public ResponseEntity<InlineObject6> createUser(CreateUserRequest body) {
        // your business logic here
        return new ResponseEntity<>(response, HttpStatus.CREATED);
    }
}
```
 
- Spring auto-injects your service into the controller
- Methods you don't override keep their default `NOT_IMPLEMENTED` response
- Never touch the generated controller or interface
